# Adyen - Engineered for ambition

> End-to-end payments, data, and financial management in one solution. Meet the financial technology platform that helps you realize your ambitions faster.

## Main

- [Adyen: Fintech platform for enterprises](https://www.adyen.com/): Run payments, manage your data, and offer financial products in one platform. Adyen is purpose-built for the world's leading businesses.
