- [Offer PayTo for direct bank payments in Australia](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/offer-payto-for-direct-bank-payments-in-australia): PayTo is now generally available in Australia, giving your shoppers a convenient way to authorize one-off and recurring payments directly from their bank accounts.
- [Simplify your Adobe Commerce payment integration](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/simplify-your-adobe-payment-integration): Version 11 of Adyen’s Adobe Commerce plugin brings improved regional support, more reliable payment handling, and new tools to keep your integration running smoothly.
- [India Expansion Made Easy](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/india-expansion-made-easy): Launch in India faster with Adyen’s local acquiring. Accept INR payments, UPI, RuPay, and global cards through one platform, using your existing integration while staying fully compliant.
- [Enable Dynamic Currency Conversion yourself with new self-service controls](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/enable-dynamic-currency-conversion-yourself-with-new-self-service-controls): Turn on and configure Dynamic Currency Conversion directly in the Customer Area or Management API, without contacting Support.
- [Reduce friction for trusted shoppers with Risk Based Exemptions](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/reduce-friction-for-trusted-shoppers-with-risk-based-exemptions): Reduce unnecessary authentication for trusted shoppers by using machine learning to identify low-risk transactions and request authentication exemptions where supported.
- [Let your users choose a repayment schedule that fits their business](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/let-your-users-choose-a-repayment-schedule-that-fits-their-business): Offer the optionality of 3, 6, or 12-month terms and allow your users to unlock higher funding amounts, now in pilot. 
- [Manage your mobile device fleet with greater visibility](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/manage-your-mobile-device-fleet-with-greater-visibility): Track the latest activity across your SoftPOS devices with new filters and activity data in the Customer Area, making it easier to identify inactive devices and troubleshoot your fleet.
- [Let decision-makers collaborate on onboarding](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/let-decision-makers-collaborate-on-onboarding): You can now instantly delegate data collection during onboarding by inviting decision-makers to provide their own details. Reduce delays, get your users live days faster, and complete onboarding without additional development work.
- [Expand Buy Now, Pay Later reach across Europe with Alma](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/expand-buy-now-pay-later-reach-across-europe-with-alma): Offer flexible Alma payment plans in seven European markets to help customers pay over time and increase conversion across your checkout.
- [Bring flexible Capital offers to your API experience](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/bring-flexible-capital-offers-to-your-api-experience): Let users customize their loan offers  directly through your Capital API to improve conversion and match real business needs.
- [Stronger control over US bank transfers with direct Adyen banking connectivity](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/stronger-control-over-us-bank-transfers-with-direct-adyen-banking-connectivity): US bank transfers now run on Adyen's direct licensed banking infrastructure — giving you faster settlement, greater reliability, and clearer visibility.
- [Accelerate access to Capital with early loan renewals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/accelerate-access-to-capital-with-early-loan-renewals): Drive your users' continuous growth by granting them access to new loans faster by offering them before their current balance is fully repaid.
- [Reach millions of Revolut users with Revolut Pay](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/reach-millions-of-revolut-users-with-revolut-pay): Revolut Pay is now available in pilot for eligible businesses in the EEA and Great Britain, helping you reach one of Europe's largest digital banking customer bases while improving checkout conversion.
- [Tailor your Buy Now, Pay Later strategy with flexible Affirm financing packages](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/tailor-your-buy-now-pay-later-strategy-with-flexible-affirm-financing-packages): Choose from three configurable Affirm packages to match your business goals. Offer the right financing options for your customers while helping increase conversion and average order value in the US and Canada.
- [Add industry context to your refund analysis](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/add-industry-context-to-your-refund-analysis): New updates to the Refunds tab in the Risk & Dispute Dashboard help you analyze refund rates against similar businesses and investigate refund behavior at shopper level.
- [Improve fraud detection accuracy with updated Score signals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/improve-fraud-detection-accuracy-with-updated-score-signals): We’ve updated Score account linking and fraud ring detection to reduce false positives and make investigations easier for your risk teams. The new setup gives you clearer visibility into which entities triggered specific risk signals.
- [Cloud Device API is now available for cloud terminal integrations](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/cloud-api-is-now-available-for-cloud-terminal-integrations): A new developer-friendly API for cloud terminals, giving you better visibility, stronger security, and improved device monitoring.
- [Manage nonprofit onboarding requests directly from the Customer Area](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/manage-nonprofit-onboarding-requests-directly-from-the-customer-area): Request nonprofit onboarding, track progress in real time, and stay informed with Giving notifications, all from the Customer Area.
- [Introducing Adyen Agentic](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/introducing-adyen-agentic): An open infrastructure layer connecting your platform to the emerging AI ecosystem.
- [Spend less time onboarding JCB Japan](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/spend-less-time-onboarding-jcb-japan): We've simplified the JCB Japan onboarding process by automating application steps and reducing manual information requests. This helps you activate JCB acceptance faster with less administrative work.
- [Upload bank documents with instant feedback](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/upload-bank-documents-with-instant-feedback): Adyen Document VerifAI improves the onboarding experience by automatically identifying bank documents and providing real-time feedback on document quality. This helps reduce delays and keeps onboarding moving forward.
- [Set custom CashOut limits for your users](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/set-custom-cashout-limits-for-your-users): You can now request custom CashOut limits for your users. Previously, CashOut requests were capped at €10,000 per user every 24 hours. 
- [Manage TWINT disputes directly in Adyen](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/manage-twint-disputes-directly-in-adyen): TWINT dispute management is now fully integrated into Adyen. Review, defend, and track TWINT disputes through the Customer Area, Disputes API, and webhooks without manual processes or email-based workflows.
- [New Protect insights dashboards for better risk visibility](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/new-protect-insights-dashboards-for-better-risk-visibility): We’ve launched new Protect dashboards to help you understand risk rules and performance more clearly across your setup.
- [Add donations to your checkout with Checkout Sessions and Salesforce Composable Storefront](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/add-donations-to-your-checkout-with-checkout-sessions-and-salesforce-composable-storefront): You can now enable Giving through Checkout Sessions and Salesforce Composable Storefront, making it easier to fundraise for causes directly in your checkout experience.
- [Launch a new revenue stream with CashOut, now available to all platforms](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/launch-a-new-revenue-stream-with-cashout-now-available-to-all-platforms): CashOut is now available to all platform customers, giving your users on-demand access to pending sales balances while creating a new revenue opportunity for your platform.
- [Speed up US onboarding with automatic bank account verification](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/speed-up-us-onboarding-with-automatic-banl-account-verification): US users can now verify their bank accounts instantly during onboarding with ValidiFI. This reduces document uploads and helps more users complete onboarding without interruption.
- [Enable iDEAL payments with Adyen Business Accounts in the Netherlands](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/enable-ideal-payments-with-adyen-business-accounts-in-the-netherlands): Adyen is now a certified iDEAL Issuer Bank for Embedded Financial Products. Business Account users in the Netherlands can now make iDEAL payments directly from their Adyen-issued accounts.
- [Scalapay move to Sales Day Payout](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/scalapay-moves-to-sales-day-payout): Scalapay now follow Sales Day Payout, giving you more predictable and easier-to-reconcile payouts.
- [Launch payouts faster with Managed Payouts](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/launch-payout-faster-with-managed-payouts): Managed Payouts is now generally available for platforms using Embedded Payments. Simplify payout setup with pre-configured schedules and deliver more predictable payout arrival times for your users.
- [Defend Accel chargebacks directly in Customer Area and API](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/defend-accel-chargebacks-directly-in-your-customer-area-and-api): You can now manage and defend Accel chargebacks through the Customer Area and Dispute API. This gives your teams more control over dispute management across supported US Debit payment methods.
- [Complete Adyen Capital applications in one flow](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/complete-adyen-capital-applications-in-one-flow): Your users can now request and complete Adyen Capital without leaving your platform, creating a faster and more intuitive funding experience.
- [Reconcile your Adyen receivables faster with the new Account Receivable reconciliation feature](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/reconcile-your-adyen-receivables-faster-with-the-new-account-receivable-reconciliation-feature): Generate self-service receivable statements in the Customer Area that align with your closing schedule and time zone. Reconcile faster with transaction-level detail and clear finance reporting.
- [Onboard European nonprofits faster with Goodstack](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/onboard-european-nonprofits-faster-with-goodstack): You can now onboard nonprofits across the EEA in days, with no minimum volume requirement.
- [Store AMEX Cards for Guest Checkout and Card-on-File in India](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/store-amex-cards-for-guest-checkout-and-card-on-file-in-india): You can now offer American Express guest checkout and card-on-file in India, making it easier for your customers to pay again without re-entering their card details.
- [Upgrade to Checkout v72 for more reliable payment flows](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/upgrade-to-checkout-v72-for-more-reliable-payment-flows): Our latest Checkout API release improves validation, payment flow reliability, and developer feedback. Upgrade to reduce avoidable payment failures and simplify online payment integration.
- [Unify the complete funds flow with Intelligent Money Movement](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/unify-the-complete-flow-of-funds-with-intelligent-money-movement): A unified approach to payments, liquidity, and payouts that helps you optimize working capital 
- [Expanded Sales Day Payout coverage across key payment methods](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/expanded-sales-day-payout-coverage-across-key-payment-methods): Affirm, Alma, and Oney now follow sales day payout, giving you more consistent payouts and reducing reconciliation effort.
- [Optimized decision-maker task to speed up onboarding](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/optimized-decision-maker-task-to-speed-up-onboarding): A renewed decision-maker overview and task flow gives your users clearer guidance, faster progress, and fewer onboarding delays.
- [Verify bank accounts instantly with SurePay Verification of Payee](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/verify-bank-accounts-instantly-with-surepay-verification-of-payee): Real-time bank account verification is now built into onboarding. Validate IBAN and account holder names instantly and reduce manual document reviews.
- [Adyen Capital: Funding for businesses up to €100k](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/adyen-capital-funding-for-businesses-up-to-100k): Your platform users can now access up to €100k in funding through Adyen Capital, helping them grow faster with flexible, data-driven financing.
- [Monitor your mobile fleet directly in the Customer Area](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/monitor-your-mobile-fleet-directly-in-the-customer-area): Get visibility into the SDK and OS versions running across your mobile devices so you can prevent payment disruptions and troubleshoot faster.
- [UPI disputes integrated into your global workflow](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/upi-disputes-integrated-into-your-global-workflow): You can now manage UPI disputes in India through the same dispute tools you already use in the Customer Area and Dispute API. This update removes manual processes and helps you stay in control across markets.
- [Scalapay move to Sales Day Payout](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/more-payment-methods-move-to-sales-day-payout): Scalapay now follow Sales Day Payout, giving you more predictable and easier-to-reconcile payouts.
- [Better visibility into DCC margins and acceptance](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/better-visibility-into-dcc-margins-and-acceptance): Track DCC acceptance, revenue, directly in the Customer Area with the new Dynamic Currency Conversion dashboard.
- [Tap to Pay on iPhone now available in Singapore and Hong Kong](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/tap-to-pay-on-iphone-now-available-in-singapore-and-hong-kong): Accept UnionPay and other payments with Tap to Pay on iPhone, giving your customers faster, contactless checkout in Singapore and Hong Kong.
- [Pass on payment fees with commercial card surcharges](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/pass-on-payment-fees-with-commercial-card-surcharges): Offset payment processing fees by passing on surcharges for commercial card payments, all while staying in control of your pricing.
- [Manage Giving campaigns faster with new store and list views](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/manage-giving-campaigns-faster-with-new-store-and-list-views): Our new interfaces in Giving help you manage stores and campaigns at scale with better search, filtering, and visibility.
- [Smarter checkout, built on global intelligence](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/smarter-checkout-built-on-global-intelligence): Deliver smarter, more profitable checkout experiences with Personalize, now live for businesses using our hosted checkout solutions.
- [Simpler terminal ordering and reporting in the Customer Area](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/simpler-terminal-ordering-and-reporting-in-the-customer-area): Assign terminals to stores at the time of order and download detailed order reports directly from the Customer Area, helping your teams reduce manual work and stay in control at scale.
- [Dynamic Currency Conversion now supports 25 additional currencies](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/dynamic-currency-conversion-now-supports-25-additional-currencies): Dynamic Currency Conversion now supports 25 additional currencies, increasing coverage from 35 to 60 and helping you offer currency choice on more international transactions.
- [A refreshed checkout UI for Pay by Link and Hosted Checkout](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/a-refreshed-checkout-ui-for-pay-by-link-and-hosted-checkout): Pay by Link and Hosted Checkout are getting a standardized shopper-facing UI to improve brand consistency, trust, and scalability.
- [Run Giving campaigns on SFO1](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/run-giving-campaigns-on-sfo1): We’re excited to bring Giving to SFO1 terminals. Engage shoppers at checkout, create a cleaner on-brand experience, and make every interaction more impactful.
- [Support mandatory instant payments in Greece with IRIS](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/support-mandatory-instant-paments-in-greece-with-iris): IRIS is now available through Adyen, helping you meet new Greek regulations by offering a required local instant payment method online and in store.
- [Get deeper transaction insights with the updated Transactions Component](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/get-deeper-transaction-insights-with-the-updated-transaction-component): All platforms on balance can embed the upgraded Transactions Component in their portals, giving users improved insights, export options, and clearer fee visibility.
- [Activate AMEX globally via self-service](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/activate-amex-globally-via-self-service): AMEX can now be activated instantly across all customer types and contract types through self-service in the Customer Area or via the /paymentMethodSettings endpoint.
- [Simplify financial reconciliation with our new dashboard](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/simplify-financial-reconciliation-with-our-new-dashboard): We’ve launched a new financial reconciliation dashboard for Platforms and Issuing customers. It gives your finance team a clear, aggregated view of your Liable Account, reducing manual work and helping you close your books faster.
- [Eftpos support for Apple Pay in-app payments](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/eftpos-support-for-apple-pay-in-app-payments): Route Apple Pay in-app transactions through eftpos to apply least cost routing and reduce payment processing costs when shoppers pay with Apple Pay.
- [Embed Pay by Link into your platform with our newest component](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/embed-pay-by-link-into-your-platform-with-our-newest-component): Let users create, manage, and share secure payment links directly within your platform.
- [Spot refund trends faster with the new Refund Activity tab](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/spot-refund-trends-faster-with-the-new-refund-activity-dashboard): You can now track refund patterns, directly in the Risk & Dispute Dashboard. This new tab gives visibility into refund volumes, overlaps with disputes, and top contributors, helping you identify trends and take action faster. 
- [Adyen wins an Award for making IPP accessible for visually impaired shoppers](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/adyen-wins-an-aware-for-making-ipp-accessible-for-visually-impared-shoppers): Accessible Audio Solution helps visually impaired shoppers pay with confidence. Fully EAA-compliant, award-winning, and designed to make in-person payments inclusive by default.
- [Make in-store payments accessible to all your customers](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/make-in-store-payments-accessible-to-all-your-customers): Support every customer in-store with our new accessibility feature that enables independent PIN entry through audio prompts.
- [Give users more flexibility and monetize payouts with Cash Out](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/give-users-more-flexibility-and-monetize-payouts-with-cashout): Offer faster access to funds and create new revenue streams with Cash Out, now available for platforms.
- [Disputes Component now supports all defendable payment methods](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/disputes-component-now-supports-all-defendable-payment-methods): All platforms on balance can embed the updated Disputes Component in their portals, giving users more control over disputing transactions across multiple payment methods.
- [Accept BLIK Code payments across all Adyen terminals in Poland](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/accept-blik-code-payments-across-all-adyen-terminals-in-poland): BLIK Code is available on all Adyen terminal ranges, helping you offer a trusted local payment method that shoppers in Poland already use through their banking apps.
- [Link donations to the original transaction with a new reporting field](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/link-donations-to-the-original-transaction-with-a-new-reporting-field): A new column in the Processed donations report lets you connect each Adyen Giving donation to the original transaction, making analysis and customer insights easier.
- [Secure your webhooks with OAuth 2.0](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/secure-your-webhooks-with-oauth-2-0): You can now use Open Authorization 2.0 to authenticate Standard webhooks, giving your platform a stronger and more secure way to receive events from Adyen.
- [Download Adyen Capital offers directly from your Customer Area](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/download-adyen-capital-offers-directly-from-your-customer-area): Access all eligible Adyen Capital offers in one place. Daily updates keep your campaigns current and targeted to each customer’s pre-qualified financing.
- [Download your Circularization Letter directly from the Customer Area](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/download-your-circularization-letter-directly-from-the-customer-area): Your Circularization Letter is now available for download on the first day of the month through the Customer Area, helping you prepare audits faster without manual requests.
- [Faster, more accurate onboarding with the new identity flow in Hosted Onboarding](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/faster-more-accurate-onboarding-with-the-new-identity-flow-in-hosted-onboarding): Improve first-time verification rates and speed up onboarding with new ID capture, autofill, and a guided questionnaire for successful decision-maker role selection.
- [Turn mobile into countertop with the new NYC1 Dock](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/turn-mobile-into-countertop-with-the-new-nyc1-dock): The NYC1 Dock brings added flexibility to your in-person setup. It offers USB connectivity and a fixed countertop option for your NYC1 Card Reader, removing the need for a separate payment terminal.
- [Faster visibility into your Giving campaign performance](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/faster-visibility-into-your-giving-campaign-performance): Your Campaign insights dashboard now updates every hour, so you can track donation activity as soon as it starts.
- [Verify cardholder names with Name Validation](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/verify-cardholder-names-with-name-validation): We’ve launched Name Validation to help you verify a cardholder’s name with the issuing bank during a zero-amount transaction. Reduce fraud, meet KYC requirements, and make more confident payment decisions.
- [Tap to Pay on Android now supports Eftpos in Australia](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/tap-to-pay-on-android-now-supports-eftpos-in-australia): Accept Eftpos payments on Android devices with Tap to Pay and take advantage of lower costs through least-cost routing for co-branded debit cards. Launch quickly with SDK version 2.8.0 or higher.
- [Discover your most valuable growth opportunities with the new Recommendations page](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/discover-your-most-valuable-growth-opportunities-with-the-new-recommendations-page): Explore a single, refreshed view of every revenue and cost-impacting recommendation tailored to your business. Prioritize what matters, act faster, and focus on the opportunities that drive the greatest uplift.
- [Tap to Pay on Android and NYC1 now available in Mexico](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/tap-to-pay-on-android-and-nyc1-now-available-in-mexico): Accept payments on Android devices or with the compact NYC1 card reader in Mexico. Reduce queues, expand where you sell, and give customers more ways to pay.
- [Create campaigns with your preferred nonprofits ](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/create-campaigns-with-your-preferred-nonprofits): You can now choose campaigns from a comprehensive nonprofits library. Launch on your schedule with no extra setup or wait times.
- [Give your franchisees users more control over their terminals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/give-your-franchisee-users-more-control-over-their-terminals): Your users can now order, replace, and return payment terminals directly in Essentials. This update makes terminal management faster and simpler for them, and reduces manual work for your teams.
- [Introducing the Disputes Dashboard](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/introducing-the-disputes-dashboard): Get a clear view of your dispute performance in your Customer Area. Analyze trends, identify root causes, and take action to increase win rates, all in one dashboard.
- [New! Smarter, stronger payment terminals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/new-smarter-stronger-payment-terminals): Meet the S1E4 Pro and S1F4 Pro, our smart mobile terminals that are built to last. The S1E4 Pro is drop-proof and durable for dynamic environments. The S1F4 Pro is a portable all-in-one terminal with a printer. Both run your apps and are PCI 7 ready.
- [Secure in-person payments with PCI MPoC certified mobile solutions](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/secure-in-person-payments-pci-mpoc-certified-mobile-solutions): NYC1 and Tap to Pay on Android are now PCI MPoC certified. This validates that our solution provides the strongest protection and the most secure way to pay without compromising on convenience. 
- [Your payment method view just went global](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/your-payment-view-just-went-global): You can now see all payment methods available for your business type, not just those in your country of operation. Get recommendations based on shopper preferences and add new methods directly in your Customer Area.
- [Defend JCB disputes directly in the Customer Area](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/defend-jcb-disputes-directly-in-the-customer-area): Save time and reduce manual effort by managing JCB disputes and RFIs directly in the Customer Area or via the Disputes API.
- [Share tokens securely with Forward API](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/share-tokens-securely-with-forward-api): A new way to connect your Adyen tokenized cards with other payment partners, securely, efficiently, and without expanding your PCI scope.
- [Reduce false declines with Risk Based Authentication in Protect Premium](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/reduce-false-declines-with-risk-based-authentication-in-protect-premium): We’ve enhanced Protect Premium with Risk Based Authentication, combining Protect and Authenticate to help you reduce false declines, recover legitimate shoppers, and stay protected through 3DS liability shift.
- [Run Giving campaigns per store and connect locally](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/run-giving-campaigns-per-store-and-connect-locally): With store-level campaigns in Campaign Manager, you can tailor donations to any of your brands and store locations , making Giving more relevant and engaging for your customers.
- [Optimize payments ahead of peak season with the redesigned Uplift overview](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/optimize-payments-ahead-of-peak-season-with-the-redesigned-uplift-overview): Discover the refreshed Uplift overview dashboard, your new command center for performance optimization. See how your payment conversion performance, fraud rates, and cost savings work together to drive growth.
- [ Simplify Tap to Pay integration with Adyen’s Android Payments App](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/simplify-tap-to-pay-integration-with-adyens-android-payments-app): Integrate Tap to Pay easily with Adyen’s Android Payments App. No SDK needed, minimal effort, automatic updates, and no PCI MPOC scope for you.
- [Localized shopper statements now available in Japan](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/localized-shopper-statements-now-available-in-japan): You can now display localized business names on shoppers’ bank statements in Japan, helping reduce confusion and chargebacks.
- [Tokenized Amex guest checkout now available in India](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/tokenized-amex-guest-checkout-now-available-in-inda): You can now offer Amex guest checkout in India with tokenization, enabling compliant and secure transactions for your shoppers.
- [Stay on top of API updates with the new API Diff Tool](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/stay-on-top-of-api-updates-with-the-new-api-diff-tool): Compare Adyen API versions, spot breaking changes early, and find what’s new,  all directly in the API Explorer.
- [Adyen Docs is ready for Agentic Usage](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/adyen-docs-is-ready-for-agentic-usage): We’ve updated our documentation to be easily consumed by AI / large language models (LLMs) to find and use accurate Adyen content.
- [Boost success rates on external tokens with PAN retry logic](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/boost-success-rates-on-external-tokens-with-pan-retry-logic): You can now increase authorization rates when using external network tokens, thanks to our new PAN retry logic.
- [Bring your brand to life on Android terminals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/bring-your-brand-to-life-on-android-terminals): We’ve refreshed the terminal experience with a new design system and built-in branding options. Now your checkout experience looks sharper, feels more modern, and reflects your brand right out of the box.
- [PIN-on-glass now supported on the NYC1 Card Reader](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/pin-on-glass-now-supported-on-the-nyc1-card-reader): The NYC1 Card Reader now supports PIN-on-glass functionality on iOS and Android. Launch in-person payments globally with a compact, secure solution that puts convenience first.
- [View capability status changes with the new audit log for platforms](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/view-capability-status-changes-with-the-new-audit-log-for-platforms): Stay informed with a clear view of capability changes on the account holder details page in the Customer Area.
- [Turn fraud rule insights into revenue gains](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/turn-fraud-rule-insights-into-revenue-gains): Get actionable recommendations on your risk rules to reduce false declines, approve more good payments, and unlock higher revenue.
- [Access all your settings in one place](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/access-all-your-settings-in-one-place): We’ve centralized all Customer Area settings into a single page, making it easier for you to find what you need, faster.
- [Build flexible, on-Brand checkouts with Adyen Web Components and Recurly – Now with Intelligent Payment Routing](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/build-flexible-on-brand-checkouts-with-adyen-web-components-and-recurly-now-with-intelligent-payment-routing): We're piloting Adyen Web Components to support Recurly, giving you more control over your checkout experience, access to a broader set of Adyen products, and the power of intelligent payment routing for optimized conversions.
- [Accept Combo Card Payments in Brazil Without integration required](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/accept-combo-card-payments-in-brazil-without-integration-required): You can now offer Brazil’s most common payment experience using Combo Cards with credit, debit, and installments through a built-in solution enabled by configuration.
- [Save time with bulk transaction descriptions](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/save-time-with-bulk-transaction-descriptions): You can now configure transaction descriptions in bulk, no need to edit them one by one.
- [Longer battery life on Android terminals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/longer-battery-life-on-android-terminals): We’ve extended the battery life of all Android terminals starting from version V1_118. With major optimizations in the Adyen payments app, you’ll get more uptime with every charge.
- [Adyen Capital expands to Canada](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/adyen-capital-expands-to-canads): We’re bringing Capital to more platforms. You can offer fast, flexible business funding across Sweden, the UK, the US, Australia, France, Finland, and now Canada.
- [Smarter fraud decisions, made visible](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/smarter-fraud-decisions-made-visible): See exactly how our machine learning models assess fraud risk. Get insights into the signals behind each decision so you can act with more confidence and control.
- [Data collection to detect fraud: Support for encrypted cards API](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/data-collection-to-detect-fraud-support-for-encrypted-cards-api): We’re making fraud prevention smarter. Our Payment Optimization SDK is now embedded in the Encrypted Cards API, improving authorization rates while reducing fraud.
- [Keep sales moving even without a connection](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/keep-sales-moving-even-without-a-connection): With Store and Forward now available for Tap to Pay on iPhone in the US, your users can keep accepting payments even when offline. 
- [PIX via Open Finance: fewer steps, more conversion](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/pix-via-open-finance-fewer-steps-more-conversion): Let shoppers pay without leaving the checkout. PIX Open Finance is now available for customers in Brazil, helping you boost conversion and reduce costs with an embedded, no-redirect payment flow.
- [Capital now available in France and Finland](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/capital-now-available-in-france-and-finland): Give your users access to fast, flexible funding. Capital has expanded to France and Finland, helping you support business growth where and when it’s needed most.
- [Lower costs and high approval rates with US Debit on IPP](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/lower-costs-and-high-approval-rates-with-us-debit-on-ipp): US Debit with Intelligent Payment Routing is now available on IPP, helping you save on transaction costs while keeping approval rates high.
- [Adyen is live with Intelligent Payment Routing powering US debit cards](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/adyen-is-live-with-intelligent-payment-routing-powering-us-debit-cards): Unlock savings and boost payment performance with Adyen's new AI-driven payment routing for US debit cards.
- [Maximize conversion under Japan’s 3DS regulation](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/maximize-conversion-under-japans-3ds-regulation): Stay compliant and reduce checkout friction with Risk Based Authentication, now live for Japan’s 3DS mandate.
- [Optimize your performance with experimentation](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/optimize-your-performance-with-experimentation): You can now test Adyen’s optimization features directly in your Customer Area, no extra integration needed. See what works best before going live.
- [Network Token Optimization is now available for all platforms](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/network-token-optimization-is-now-available-for-all-platforms): Better authorization rates, cost savings, and performance, now extended to all platform merchants.
- [Enable instant payouts with CashOut](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/enable-instant-payouts-with-cashout): Offer faster access to funds and create new revenue streams with CashOut, now available to platforms.
- [More control over surcharge settings](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/more-control-over-surcharge-settings): Decide whether to apply surcharges on tips or not. You’re now in full control of how payment fees are passed on to your customers.
- [Accept payments on kiosks with Tap to Pay on Android ](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/accept-payments-on-kiosks-with-tap-to-pay-on-android): Kiosk mode now works on large-screen Android devices, helping you power tablet-based payment flows in semi-unattended environments.
- [Accelerate integration with new platform-ready components](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/accelerate-integration-with-new-platform-ready-components): We’ve launched new prebuilt UI components to help you integrate faster and give users a clearer view of their transactions and bank details.
- [The Customer Area is now available in Chinese](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/the-customer-area-is-now-available-in-chinese): We’ve added Chinese language support to the Customer Area, making it easier for more users to manage their accounts in their preferred language.
- [Accurate pricing in every currency, automatically](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/accurate-pricing-in-every-currency-automatically): Say goodbye to manual conversions. Our API now calculates and displays local pricing for both shoppers and your users, instantly and accurately. 
- [Introducing the MCP server: A smarter way to build with Adyen](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/introducing-the-mcp-server-a-smarter-way-to-build-with-adyen): We’re piloting our Model Context Protocol (MCP) server to help developers build faster using natural language. It’s a new way to interact with our APIs and bring ideas to life more efficiently.
- [Put chargebacks in your users’ hands with the Disputes Component](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/put-chargebacks-in-your-users-hands-with-the-disputes-component): Our new Disputes Component gives users control over their chargebacks, reducing operational overhead for your platform.
- [Faster access to platform balance data](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/faster-access-to-platform-balance-data): You can now view account holders, balance accounts, and transfers directly at the company level in the Customer Area.
- [Custom packaging now available for platforms](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/custom-packaging-now-available-for-platforms): Give your brand more visibility and help your SMBs activate faster. You can now opt into branded sleeves and activation inserts for terminal shipments.
- [Upgrade your checkout experience with the SFO1](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/upgrade-your-experience-with-the-sfo1): The SFO1 terminal is now available across the US, Canada, EU, and UK. It combines functionality, branding, and customer engagement, all in one display.
- [Offer Capital to your SMBs easily with our new Component](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/offer-capital-to-your-users-easily-with-our-new-component): Our new low-code component makes it easier to provide loans to your SMBs with less development work.
- [Expanded capability: reading non-PCI cards with Adyen terminals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/expanded-capability-reading-non-pci-cards-with-adyen-terminals): Adyen terminals now support reading non-PCI card data, including gift, loyalty, and meal vouchers, increasing your payment options and improving the checkout experience.
- [Native support for Alipay+ network on our terminals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/native-support-for-alipay-plus-network-on-our-terminals): We’re excited to announce that our terminals now natively support the Alipay+ network. This allows smooth integration with 15 digital wallets, giving you access to over 1.3 billion users.
- [Introducing Single-Tap Adyen Giving on Android](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/introducing-single-tap-adyen-giving-on-android): We’ve made donating even easier with Single-Tap Adyen Giving on Android, eliminating extra steps to enhance user experience and boost donation conversions.
- [New tipping flexibility: set tip amounts separately from transaction totals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/new-tipping-flexibility-set-tip-amounts-separately-from-transaction-totals): Our latest firmware update (103) introduces the ability to specify tip amounts separately from the total transaction, giving your customers an easier, more flexible tipping experience.
- [Fallback to manual key entry after two failed gift card swipes](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/fallback-to-manual-key-entry-after-two-failed-gift-card-swipes): Adyen terminals now automatically switch to Manual Key Entry after two failed gift card swipes, ensuring seamless transactions even when card swipes fail.
- [Faster gift card transactions with saved PINs](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/faster-gift-card-transactions-with-saved-pins): Say goodbye to repeated PIN entries. Our latest update improves the gift card experience by securely caching entered PINs, making balance checks and redemptions quicker and easier.
- [The P630 terminal is here](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/the-p630-terminal-is-here): Meet the all-in-one Android terminal designed for seamless payments and business applications. Now available for test and live use across the EU, UK, and US.
- [Activate donations from your Customer Area](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/activate-donations-from-your-customer-area): Adyen Giving is now available directly in the Customer Area, making it easier than ever to launch and manage donation campaigns.
- [Announcing MED flow automation](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/announcing-med-flow-automation): We’re streamlining the chargeback process for Pix payments. With automated request handling, you can reduce manual effort and focus on what matters.
- [ Stay compliant with Greek tax requirements](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/stay-compliant-with-greek-tax-requirements): Version 1.107.7 now supports the latest Greek tax regulations. Upgrade to stay compliant and integrate with a certified e-invoice provider.
- [Boost your payment conversion with Adyen Uplift](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/boost-your-payment-conversion-with-adyen-uplift): Introducing Adyen Uplift, our AI-powered payment optimization suite designed to enhance payment conversion rates, simplify fraud management, and reduce costs.
- [Boost conversion with PayPal Express on SFCC](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/boost-conversion-with-paypal-express-on-sfcc): Upgrade your Salesforce Commerce Cloud integration with the new PayPal Express feature. Offer a faster, seamless checkout experience and increase conversion by adding the PayPal Express button to your Cart and Mini-cart pages.
- [Introducing Flutter Drop-in/Components: Native payments made easy](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/introducing-flutter-drop-in-components-native-payments-made-easy): All Flutter developers can natively integrate Adyen Checkout for smoother payments and improved conversion rates.
- [Upgrade to Web Drop-in/Components v6 for enhanced features and better conversion](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/upgrade-to-web-drop-in-components-v6-for-enhanced-features-and-better-conversion): This upgrade brings key improvements to optimize your payment experience and boost conversion, including a fresh design, Apple Pay order tracking, and new languages.
- [PayPal Express now available for Adobe Commerce](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/paypal-express-now-available-for-adobe-commerce): Adobe Commerce users can now offer PayPal Express through the Express Checkout module 2.2.0, speeding up checkout and boosting conversions.
- [Say goodbye to system messages, your new Service Status Page is live.](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/say-goodbye-to-system-messages-your-new-service-status-page-is-live): We’re replacing system messages with a personalized Service Status Page, giving you real time updates tailored to your account in one convenient place.
- [Klarna in-store: Buy Now, Pay Later at the terminal](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/klarna-in-store-buy-now-pay-later-at-the-terminal): Offer your customers more flexibility at checkout. Klarna in-store is now available globally through Adyen, letting shoppers pay in installments by scanning a QR code at the terminal.
- [Apple Pay and Google Pay now available for Intelligent Payment Routing on US debit cards](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/apple-pay-and-google-pay-now-available-for-intelligent-payment-routing-on-us-debit-cards): Save on processing costs while offering Apple Pay and Google Pay, now supported with Intelligent Payment Routing for US debit.
- [Reduce checkout friction with PIN bypass](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/reduce-checkout-friction-with-pin-bypass): This new feature allows shoppers to skip PIN entries while maintaining compliance; no extra integration required.
- [Facilitate terminal management with OTP reassignment](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/facilitate-terminal-management-with-otp-reassignment): You can now securely reassign boarded terminals to different stores or merchant accounts using the One Time Password boarding flow.
- [Boost approval rates with Store and Forward retry](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/boost-approval-rates-with-store-and-forward-retry): Leveraging Adyen's AutoRescue retry mechanism, we automatically retry failed Store and Forward eligible payments, improving your chances of success.
- [Expanded gift card capabilities on standalone terminals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/expanded-gift-card-capabilities-on-standalone-terminals): You can now accept and manage gift cards directly on Verifone VOS terminals in Standalone mode; no integration is needed.
- [Faster and more flexible barcode scanning](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/faster-and-more-flexible-barcode-scanning): We’ve enhanced barcode scanning on Android terminals, making it faster, easier, and more adaptable to your needs.
- [P630 is now available with Interac in Canada](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/p630-is-now-available-with-interac-in-canada): The Verifone P630 is now certified for Interac, offering a secure, all-in-one Android payment solution as a PCI 6.x alternative to the P400Plus.
- [LTS only in the terminal software update tool](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/lts-only-in-the-terminal-software-update-tool): The terminal software update tool now supports only the last three Long Term Support (LTS) versions, ensuring stability with essential fixes while reducing update frequency.
- [Log in to multiple company accounts with a single set of credentials](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/log-in-to-multiple-company-accounts-with-a-single-set-of-credentials): This new feature enables users to access multiple company accounts using just one login. Streamline the experience with unified credentials across both Test and Live environments.
- [Generate multiple IPARs without delays](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/generate-multiple-ipars-without-delays): No more waiting or overwritten reports. Now, you can generate multiple Interactive Payment Accounting Reports (IPARs) simultaneously, each with a unique file name for easy tracking.
- [Create and manage Giving campaigns without requests needed](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/create-and-manage-giving-campaigns-without-requests-needed): Take full control of your Giving campaigns. Choose a nonprofit, set up your campaign, and grant access to team members from the Customer Area.
- [A faster, smarter way to manage payment methods](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/a-faster-smarter-way-to-manage-payment-methods): No more repetitive setups. With multi-select and bulk actions, you can add Visa, Mastercard, iDEAL, and more in one go, saving time and simplifying your workflow. Stay in control with easy updates through the Customer Area.
- [Charge payment transaction fees with Tap to Pay on iPhone in Australia](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/charge-payment-transaction-fees-with-tap-to-pay-on-iphone-in-australia):  With this feature, the surcharge is automatically added after the shopper taps their card, based on your predefined configuration.
- [Customize your checkout experience on the SFO1 terminal](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/customize-your-checkout-experience-on-the-sfo1-terminal): Tailor the look and feel of your SFO1 terminal to align perfectly with your brand's identity.
- [Store and Forward is available on NYC1 (iOS)](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/store-and-forward-is-available-on-nyc1-ios): This feature will allow you to process transactions without internet connectivity. Stay flexible and keep payments flowing.
- [PIN entry support on NYC1 terminal with iOS SDK](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/pin-entry-support-on-nyc1-terminal-with-ios-sdk): PIN entry is now supported on NYC1 with our iOS SDK. Upgrade to iOS SDK 3.2.0 to support this payment flow.
- [Monitor your terminal deployment in the field with terminal webhooks](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/monitor-your-terminal-deployment-in-the-field-with-terminal-webhooks): This new webhook informs you of real-time updates when a terminal is ready to transact. 
- [Introducing SFO1: a smarter way to engage at the checkout](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/introducing-sfo1-a-smarter-way-to-engage-at-the-checkout): SFO1 is our new 8-inch Android payment terminal designed to help you simplify your setup, amplify your brand, and turn every transaction into an experience. 
- [Fix terminal issues faster with remote support](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/fix-terminal-issues-faster-with-remote-support): Get real-time support for Android terminals. Remotely view and control devices from your browser to diagnose and resolve issues instantly.
- [AMS1 is now available in Brazil](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/ams1-is-now-available-in-brazil): Our all-in-one Android payment device, AMS1, is now live in Brazil. Combine payment acceptance and business apps on a single device.
- [Upgrade your countertop experience with M450](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/upgrade-your-countertop-experience-with-m450): Introducing M450, a powerful 8-inch countertop payment terminal designed for richer customer interactions and full brand control. Now open for test and pilot orders.
- [Tax-free shopping now supported on Tap to Pay and NYC1 terminals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/tax-free-shopping-now-supported-on-tap-to-pay-and-nyc1-terminals): Our new tax-free shopping feature, now available on Tap to Pay and NYC1 terminals, simplifies international shopping and reduces checkout time.
- [Faster submerchant onboarding for PayFacs on PSP](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/faster-submerchant-onboarding-for-payfacs-on-psp): No more workarounds. PayFacs on PSP can now send submerchant data directly in the /sessions request, speeding up onboarding and simplifying operations.
- [Tap to Pay on iPhone expands to Italy, Canada, and Germany](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/tap-to-pay-on-iphone-expands-to-italy-canada-and-germany): "Accept contactless payments with just an iPhone, no extra hardware needed. Now available in Italy, Canada, and Germany.  "
- [Unified Customer Area now includes Financial Products for Platforms](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/unified-customer-area-now-includes-financial-products-for-platforms): View Issuing, Capital, and Business account details directly in the Unified Customer Area. One place to stay on top of your platform’s finances.
- [New Payout Overview Component: A Smarter Way to Reconcile Payouts](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/new-payout-overview-component-a-smarter-way-to-reconcile-payouts): Give sub-merchants full visibility into their payouts with a ready-to-use dashboard.
- [Get started faster with Onboarding on Invite](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/get-started-faster-with-onboarding-on-invite): Accelerate sub-merchant onboarding with fewer technical steps. We’ve removed any complex API setup required.
- [Stay in the loop with webhook alerts](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/stay-in-the-loop-with-webhook-alerts): Get notified when something’s off with your Balance Platform webhooks. Proactive alerts via email or the Notification Center help you catch and fix issues faster.
- [Bring checkout to the table with Pay@Table for Oracle merchants](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/bring-checkout-to-the-table-with-pay-at-table-for-oracle-merchants): Oracle merchants can offer Pay@Table on all Android terminals, allowing customers to pay directly at the table with no extra hardware or steps.
- [Easily manage terminal settings with the new Level switcher](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/easily-manage-terminal-settings-with-the-new-level-switcher): We've added a visual Level switcher to help you quickly navigate between terminal settings across accounts, stores, and devices.
- [Tap to Pay on iPhone expands to 9 more European countries](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/tap-to-pay-on-iphone-expands-to-9-more-european-countries): Accept in-person payments with just an iPhone, now in 9 more countries. No extra hardware needed, just your iPhone and the Adyen POS app.
- [Track terminal changes with Audit Logs](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/track-terminal-changes-with-audit-logs): You can now view a detailed timeline of terminal fleet events directly in the Customer Area. Know what changed, when, and who made it happen.
- [Need Help? Contact us from any page](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/need-help-contact-us-from-any-page): Now you can reach our support team instantly from any page in your Customer Area. Get faster responses, direct routing, and track tickets without leaving your workflow.
- [Easier mobile SDK access and app management for Tap to Pay](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/easier-mobile-sdk-access-and-app-management-for-tap-to-pay): Adyen mobile SDKs are now available in the Customer Area, giving your teams more control and flexibility during development.
- [Gain deeper insights into KYC verification with our newest dashboard](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/gain-deeper-insights-in-onboarding-performance-with-our-newest-dashboard): Track onboarding performance and spot bottlenecks with the new KYC verification insights dashboard, helping you streamline the process for your account holders.
- [Apple Pay is now available for all browsers on Mac, PC and beyond](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/apple-pay-is-now-available-for-all-browsers-on-mac-pc-and-beyond): With our latest update, shoppers can pay using Apple Pay on any browser, boosting conversion rates and streamlining checkout.
- [Stay ahead of card scheme thresholds with our new dashboard](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/stay-ahead-of-card-scheme-thresholds-with-our-new-dashboard): We’ve added a Card Monitoring Program dashboard to the Risk & Disputes Insights Page to help you track dispute ratios and avoid compliance issues before they happen.
- [Dynamic Currency Conversion (DCC) is available for contactless cards and wallets payments](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/dynamic-currency-conversion-dcc-is-available-for-contactless-cards-and-wallets-payments): Empower your international customers with the ability to pay in their own currency, all while enhancing their experience and boosting your revenue. DCC now supports contactless cards and mobile wallets.
- [PCI P2PE Security Now Ready on First Android Terminals](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/pci-p2pe-security-now-ready-on-first-android-terminals): PCI-approved Point-to-Point Encryption (P2PE) is now available on our initial set of Android terminals — AMS1, S1F2, S1F2L, S1E2L, and S1U2 — bringing an enhanced layer of security to your in-person payments. 
- [Enhance user experience in Denmark and Finland with MobilePay payouts](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/enhance-user-experience-in-denmark-and-finland-with-mobilepay-payouts): We’re launching MobilePay Payouts, allowing your customers in Denmark and Finland to receive payouts onto the card they have stored in their MobilePay Wallet.
- [Reply to support tickets in your Customer Area](https://www.adyen.com/the-latest/reply-to-support-tickets-in-your-customer-area): You can now reply to support tickets without leaving your Adyen Customer Area, making it easier to manage your support interactions in one place.
