## Press and Media

- [Adyen Report, Fraud's Identity Crisis: Traditional Fraud Losses Decline 20%, While First-Party Fraud Emerges as Enterprises' Greatest Threat](https://www.adyen.com/press-and-media/fraud-report-2026): Adyen's 2026 fraud report, Fraud’s Identity Crisis, revealed that fraud isn’t retreating, it’s redistributing. Risk has moved inside trusted environments. False declines are emerging as the bigger revenue threat. Agentic commerce is a new frontier.  
- [AS Colour Partners with Adyen to Complete the Global Customer Picture](https://www.adyen.com/press-and-media/as-colour-partners-with-adyen-to-complete-the-global-customer-picture): Premium apparel brand AS Colour chooses Adyen’s unified platform to eliminate data gaps and stitch together a seamless global payment experience.
