- [Adyen Index 2026: Australian Retailers Race Ahead on AI, but Consumer Trust Lags at Checkout](https://www.adyen.com/press-and-media/adyen-index-2026-australian-retailers-race-ahead-on-ai): 64% have used AI assistants to help browse, compare or discover products; 95% of enterprise retailers now familiar with agentic commerce; 64% of Australians feel uncomfortable allowing AI to complete a purchase on their behalf
